@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Fix an internal error when an object's ``__repr__`` raises and its ``__getattribute__`` also raises, by looking up the type through ``type()`` instead of ``__class__``.
diff --git a/src/_pytest/_io/saferepr.py b/src/_pytest/_io/saferepr.py
